Refused: a stable meta.json that lists proxy methods, which the SDK does not
dispatch (0054-MADR-adopt-acp-schema-1-31-0-and-client-system-prompts.md,
"Amendment 2026-11-10: the proxy methods emit nothing").

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}, "proxyMethods": {"proxy_successor": "proxy/successor"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
-- want.err --
proxy methods in the stable schema: the SDK dispatches only agent, client and protocol methods
